      horror: "Night in Asakusa. The light of the Kaminarimon great lantern sways, just for a moment. The blueprint copy vanished from the prep room without a sound.\nInside a lantern it is pitch dark, visible to no one. The perfect place to hide a human lie and a secret. Follow the traces across five famous places.",
